4952	5031	4813	4814	the constable	1302	" True enough , sir . And now look — the cloth is removed , and every one is ordering in something strong to wash down the supper . There goes a crown - bowl of punch — that 's for the begging - letter impostors : and there 's glasses of punch , and cold spirits and water , and shrub , and negus . That 's the way they do it , you see , sir . "
