86839	86917	86829	86829	he	738	" it is as we thought . Skilligalee deserted us in order to liberate Margaret Flathers . I always believed that such was the case , from the moment we received the account of her escape . But I have one more question to ask our guest . Let him satisfy us how he traced Anthony Tidkins _ to _ the Palace , and how he learnt that Anthony Tidkins was wounded _ in _ the Palace . "
