88989	89020	88987	88987	Smithers	663	" and I hope that when you see Kate again , you will ask her forgiveness in my name for all the unkindness I have shown her at different times . "
89021	89039	89041	89041	Richard	612	" You shall see her yourself — she wishes you and your son to call upon her , "
