131236	131380	131012	131012	she	769	" In the first place , Signor Mario Bazzano will procure for you a passport : his uncle is Under - Secretary for the Interior . This passport , made out for you in a fictitious name , will be dated from Montoni ; and the various authorities will never suspect that one of the invaders could possibly have obtained such a document from the capital itself . Secondly , you can purchase a portfolio with drawing materials , and pass yourself off for an English artist , sent to Castelcicala to design some of the most striking features of Italian scenery . By these means there will be an ostensible reason for avoiding the great cities and towns ; and no suspicion will be excited by your keeping as much as possible to the open country . Does my plan please you ? "
