291781	291798	291800	291801	Alderman Sniff	777	" While I was thus engaged in the behoof of the poorer classes of the community , "
291803	292016	291800	291801	Alderman Sniff	777	" I was gaining influence with my fellow citizens . I became the Treasurer of no end of charitable institutions , was elected Churchwarden of my parish , and soon became Deputy of the Ward . Fortunately my parish , as you well know , is governed by a Select Vestry — properly consisting of three individuals ; but as two of the last - elected trio have died , and as I have ever stedfastly and successfully opposed the nomination of other parishioners to replace the deceased , we have now a Select Vestry of _ One _ . This gentleman is my most intimate friend ; and it would do your heart good to see the parochial solemnity and official dignity with which he annually proposes me to himself as a candidate for the place of Churchwarden , and then proceeds to second the nomination , put the question , lift up his hand , and declare me duly elected _ without a dissentient voice _ . In due time I was chosen Alderman of the Ward ; and every thing has gone well with me . I have been eminently successful . My ' _ British Marble Company _ ' was a glorious hit , as you well know . "
