449497	449505	449507	449507	Egerton	1165	" Do not keep me in suspense , "
449511	449521	449507	449507	Egerton	1165	" what is it that you have thought of ? "
449522	449536	449538	449539	the nobleman	4032	" I 'll tell you in as few words as possible my boy , "
